                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      <p>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Cover letters are taken more seriously in many European countries than in the US. In Germany, the Anschreiben (cover letter) is considered an essential part of the application and is evaluated alongside your CV. In France, a handwritten cover letter (lettre de motivation) was historically expected, though digital versions are now standard. Even in countries where cover letters are less formal, such as the Netherlands or Sweden, a well-crafted letter tailored to the role will set you apart from candidates who skip it.
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                </p>
